    "intro_narrative": "You are the lead detective on the infamous 'Midnight Syndicate' case. A string of high-profile cyber-heists has left the city's financial sector in ruins. The suspects have vanished, leaving behind a trail of cryptic clues, locked devices, and encrypted files scattered across their abandoned hideout. The precinct has set up a makeshift forensics lab here to piece together the evidence. Your objective is to follow the digital footprints, bypass the syndicate's security measures, and uncover the mastermind's true identity. The clock is ticking before they strike again. You'll need to carefully analyze every piece of evidence, using each discovery to unlock the next, until you crack the final code.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
  },
